### Repository Management API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###############################################
### SETUP: Login first to get token
###############################################

### 1. Login to get JWT token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

###############################################
### REPOSITORY CRUD OPERATIONS
###############################################

### 2. Add Repository (Manual)
POST {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "octocat/Hello-World",
  "description": "My first repository on GitHub",
  "defaultBranch": "main",
  "enableWebhook": false
}

###

### 3. Add Another Repository
POST {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "microsoft/vscode",
  "description": "Visual Studio Code",
  "defaultBranch": "main",
  "enableWebhook": true
}

###

### 4. Get All Repositories
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Get Active Repositories Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. Get Repository by ID (Replace with actual ID from create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories/663f7b8a9e4c1d2a3b4c5d6e
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Get Repository by Full Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories/name/octocat/Hello-World
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Update Repository
PUT {{baseUrl}}/repositories/663f7b8a9e4c1d2a3b4c5d6e
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Updated description for my repository",
  "defaultBranch": "develop",
  "enableWebhook": true
}

###

### 9. Toggle Repository Status (Active/Inactive)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/repositories/663f7b8a9e4c1d2a3b4c5d6e/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 10. Get Repository Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. Search Repositories
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories/search?query=hello
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 12. Delete Repository
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/repositories/663f7b8a9e4c1d2a3b4c5d6e
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
### VALIDATION TESTS
###############################################

### 13. Add Repository - Invalid Format (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "invalid-repo-name",
  "description": "This should fail"
}

###

### 14. Add Repository - Missing Required Field (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Missing fullName field"
}

###

### 15. Add Duplicate Repository (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "octocat/Hello-World",
  "description": "Duplicate repository"
}

###

###############################################
### UNAUTHORIZED TESTS (No Token)
###############################################

### 16. Get Repositories - No Token (Should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories

###

### 17. Add Repository - No Token (Should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "owner/repo",
  "description": "Test"
}

###

###############################################
### TESTING WORKFLOW
###############################################

# STEP 1: Login and get JWT token (Test #1)
# STEP 2: Copy the accessToken
# STEP 3: Update @token variable at top
# STEP 4: Add repositories (Tests #2, #3)
# STEP 5: Get repository ID from response
# STEP 6: Test all CRUD operations
# STEP 7: Test validation and error cases

###
